# Same host-zone rule as Animate Dead (CardState.java:665, Card.java:6986), here
# with an opponent's graveyard card: "creature card in a graveyard" is any
# graveyard. The enters trigger puts the creature onto the battlefield tapped
# under the Aura controller's control (GainControl$ True, Tapped$ True) and
# re-attaches the Aura.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 B
tapformana human 3 B
queue paygeneric B
castspell human 1
resolvestack
